{"id":"forecast-13","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-13/audio-4.mp3","model":"small","duration":469.5,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":7.88,"text":"Part 4. You will hear a student of anthropology giving a presentation on ancient symbols used","words":[["Part",0.0,0.4],["4.",0.4,0.86],["You",2.26,2.28],["will",2.28,2.48],["hear",2.48,2.68],["a",2.68,2.88],["student",2.88,3.24],["of",3.24,3.5],["anthropology",3.5,4.24],["giving",4.24,4.88],["a",4.88,5.12],["presentation",5.12,5.62],["on",5.62,6.2],["ancient",6.2,6.68],["symbols",6.68,7.34],["used",7.34,7.88]]},{"start":7.88,"end":66.24,"text":"in cave art. First you have some time to look at questions 31-40. Now listen carefully and","words":[["in",7.88,8.24],["cave",8.24,8.62],["art.",8.62,9.1],["First",10.02,10.64],["you",10.64,10.86],["have",10.86,11.02],["some",11.02,11.2],["time",11.2,11.56],["to",11.56,11.8],["look",11.8,11.94],["at",11.94,12.08],["questions",12.08,12.48],["31",12.48,13.28],["-40.",13.28,13.96],["Now",64.76,65.08],["listen",65.08,65.44],["carefully",65.44,65.92],["and",65.92,66.24]]},{"start":66.24,"end":77.09,"text":"answer questions 31-40. Hello everyone. My presentation today is about the cave paintings","words":[["answer",66.24,66.62],["questions",66.62,67.0],["31",67.0,67.8],["-40.",67.8,68.44],["Hello",71.95,72.41],["everyone.",72.41,72.81],["My",73.61,73.93],["presentation",73.93,74.45],["today",74.45,75.13],["is",75.13,75.71],["about",75.71,75.95],["the",75.95,76.15],["cave",76.15,76.49],["paintings",76.49,77.09]]},{"start":77.09,"end":83.85,"text":"paintings produced by prehistoric artists about 30,000 years ago and in particular the symbols","words":[["paintings",77.09,77.27],["produced",77.27,77.61],["by",77.61,78.05],["prehistoric",78.05,78.75],["artists",78.75,79.49],["about",79.49,80.19],["30",80.19,80.69],[",000",80.69,81.07],["years",81.07,81.33],["ago",81.33,81.67],["and",81.67,82.37],["in",82.37,82.51],["particular",82.51,83.01],["the",83.01,83.45],["symbols",83.45,83.85]]},{"start":83.85,"end":91.47,"text":"that appear in or near these paintings. These symbols are found deep in caves in many countries","words":[["that",83.85,84.17],["appear",84.17,84.49],["in",84.49,85.01],["or",85.01,85.29],["near",85.29,85.59],["these",85.59,85.83],["paintings.",85.83,86.33],["These",87.23,87.63],["symbols",87.63,88.09],["are",88.09,88.59],["found",88.59,88.93],["deep",88.93,89.41],["in",89.41,89.81],["caves",89.81,90.21],["in",90.21,90.65],["many",90.65,90.99],["countries",90.99,91.47]]},{"start":91.47,"end":97.61,"text":"around the world but the ones I'm going to talk about today are mainly European. Firstly,","words":[["around",91.47,91.89],["the",91.89,92.13],["world",92.13,92.51],["but",92.51,93.11],["the",93.11,93.25],["ones",93.25,93.39],["I'm",93.39,93.69],["going",93.69,93.81],["to",93.81,93.97],["talk",93.97,94.15],["about",94.15,94.35],["today",94.35,94.71],["are",94.71,95.21],["mainly",95.21,95.67],["European.",95.67,96.51],["Firstly,",97.17,97.61]]},{"start":98.15,"end":103.77,"text":"a little about the most common symbols. The symbols that have been discovered are of","words":[["a",98.15,98.35],["little",98.35,98.53],["about",98.53,98.91],["the",98.91,99.13],["most",99.13,99.35],["common",99.35,99.75],["symbols.",99.75,100.31],["The",101.21,101.43],["symbols",101.43,101.79],["that",101.79,102.11],["have",102.11,102.21],["been",102.21,102.39],["discovered",102.39,102.85],["are",102.85,103.37],["of",103.37,103.77]]},{"start":103.77,"end":110.43,"text":"different shapes and sizes. Some are easily recognisable as they're quite simple. The","words":[["different",103.77,103.99],["shapes",103.99,104.35],["and",104.35,104.61],["sizes.",104.61,105.07],["Some",105.87,106.31],["are",106.31,106.81],["easily",106.81,107.35],["recognisable",107.35,108.19],["as",108.19,108.63],["they're",108.63,108.95],["quite",108.95,109.09],["simple.",109.09,109.49],["The",110.27,110.43]]},{"start":110.43,"end":116.67,"text":"most basic are just a series of dots, but they may also include forms such as the triangle.","words":[["most",110.43,110.59],["basic",110.59,111.09],["are",111.09,111.59],["just",111.59,111.87],["a",111.87,112.09],["series",112.09,112.31],["of",112.31,112.53],["dots,",112.53,112.97],["but",113.27,113.61],["they",113.61,113.75],["may",113.75,113.87],["also",113.87,114.21],["include",114.21,114.57],["forms",114.57,115.23],["such",115.23,115.67],["as",115.67,116.13],["the",116.13,116.31],["triangle.",116.31,116.67]]},{"start":117.63,"end":124.93,"text":"However, other symbols are more complex. A case in point is the wavy line. This is sometimes","words":[["However,",117.63,118.05],["other",118.63,118.95],["symbols",118.95,119.29],["are",119.29,119.73],["more",119.73,119.93],["complex.",119.93,120.41],["A",121.15,121.31],["case",121.31,121.51],["in",121.51,121.79],["point",121.79,122.07],["is",122.07,122.69],["the",122.69,122.87],["wavy",122.87,123.19],["line.",123.19,123.59],["This",124.15,124.43],["is",124.43,124.55],["sometimes",124.55,124.93]]},{"start":124.93,"end":131.51,"text":"used on its own, but the same wavy line is also used as part of a larger picture of","words":[["used",124.93,125.57],["on",125.57,125.95],["its",125.95,126.13],["own,",126.13,126.61],["but",126.95,127.25],["the",127.25,127.47],["same",127.47,127.75],["wavy",127.75,128.17],["line",128.17,128.55],["is",128.55,128.83],["also",128.83,129.23],["used",129.23,129.61],["as",129.61,129.91],["part",129.91,130.17],["of",130.17,130.37],["a",130.37,130.45],["larger",130.45,130.79],["picture",130.79,131.17],["of",131.17,131.51]]},{"start":131.51,"end":135.37,"text":"horse, so we think this is what the wavy line represents.","words":[["horse,",131.51,131.93],["so",132.33,132.81],["we",132.81,133.07],["think",133.07,133.43],["this",133.43,133.81],["is",133.81,133.95],["what",133.95,134.13],["the",134.13,134.29],["wavy",134.29,134.57],["line",134.57,134.89],["represents.",134.89,135.37]]},{"start":136.91,"end":143.75,"text":"One very important symbol is what's called the hand symbol. This frequently appears on","words":[["One",136.91,137.27],["very",137.27,137.81],["important",137.81,138.33],["symbol",138.33,138.73],["is",138.73,139.21],["what's",139.21,139.61],["called",139.61,139.89],["the",139.89,140.23],["hand",140.23,140.63],["symbol.",140.63,141.09],["This",142.05,142.43],["frequently",142.43,142.95],["appears",142.95,143.49],["on",143.49,143.75]]},{"start":143.75,"end":150.15,"text":"the walls of caves. I'll talk about it in a bit more detail. Firstly, how it was made.","words":[["the",143.75,143.91],["walls",143.91,144.17],["of",144.17,144.43],["caves.",144.43,144.73],["I'll",145.31,145.69],["talk",145.69,145.97],["about",145.97,146.23],["it",146.23,146.51],["in",146.51,146.73],["a",146.73,146.85],["bit",146.85,147.09],["more",147.09,147.29],["detail.",147.29,147.71],["Firstly,",148.35,148.81],["how",149.31,149.49],["it",149.49,149.67],["was",149.67,149.81],["made.",149.81,150.15]]},{"start":150.75,"end":156.41,"text":"The paint itself was made up from a variety of things that cave artists would have had","words":[["The",150.75,150.91],["paint",150.91,151.25],["itself",151.25,151.83],["was",151.83,152.29],["made",152.29,152.65],["up",152.65,152.91],["from",152.91,153.09],["a",153.09,153.25],["variety",153.25,153.65],["of",153.65,153.99],["things",153.99,154.33],["that",154.33,154.91],["cave",154.91,155.27],["artists",155.27,155.75],["would",155.75,156.17],["have",156.17,156.27],["had",156.27,156.41]]},{"start":156.41,"end":164.43,"text":"access to. They had fire, so charcoal was one ingredient, another was the fat from the animals","words":[["access",156.41,156.71],["to.",156.71,157.09],["They",157.83,158.21],["had",158.21,158.43],["fire,",158.43,158.83],["so",159.35,159.77],["charcoal",159.77,160.33],["was",160.33,160.67],["one",160.67,160.89],["ingredient,",160.89,161.35],["another",162.09,162.57],["was",162.57,162.95],["the",162.95,163.11],["fat",163.11,163.49],["from",163.49,163.83],["the",163.83,163.97],["animals",163.97,164.43]]},{"start":164.43,"end":172.27,"text":"they would have hunted, and lastly the saliva from their own mouths. Then there's a question","words":[["they",164.43,164.67],["would",164.67,164.81],["have",164.81,164.93],["hunted,",164.93,165.29],["and",165.93,166.37],["lastly",166.37,166.87],["the",166.87,167.53],["saliva",167.53,168.03],["from",168.03,168.57],["their",168.57,168.79],["own",168.79,169.11],["mouths.",169.11,169.69],["Then",170.89,171.59],["there's",171.59,171.89],["a",171.89,171.97],["question",171.97,172.27]]},{"start":172.27,"end":178.75,"text":"of how they actually applied the runny paint onto the walls of the cave. It certainly wouldn't","words":[["of",172.27,172.61],["how",172.61,172.97],["they",172.97,173.21],["actually",173.21,173.67],["applied",173.67,174.13],["the",174.13,174.41],["runny",174.41,174.73],["paint",174.73,175.05],["onto",175.05,175.43],["the",175.43,175.67],["walls",175.67,175.93],["of",175.93,176.17],["the",176.17,176.29],["cave.",176.29,176.61],["It",177.31,177.63],["certainly",177.63,178.23],["wouldn't",178.23,178.75]]},{"start":178.75,"end":184.97,"text":"have been easy. They would have had to use something hollow. In fact, it's likely","words":[["have",178.75,178.93],["been",178.93,179.13],["easy.",179.13,179.55],["They",180.33,180.69],["would",180.69,180.85],["have",180.85,181.01],["had",181.01,181.17],["to",181.17,181.31],["use",181.31,181.57],["something",181.57,181.99],["hollow.",181.99,182.39],["In",183.23,183.53],["fact,",183.53,183.97],["it's",184.35,184.61],["likely",184.61,184.97]]},{"start":184.97,"end":191.37,"text":"to have looked like a straw, you know, like the kind we use for drinking nowadays. They'd","words":[["to",184.97,185.17],["have",185.17,185.39],["looked",185.39,185.63],["like",185.63,185.91],["a",185.91,186.07],["straw,",186.07,186.39],["you",187.05,187.37],["know,",187.37,187.57],["like",187.79,187.97],["the",187.97,188.19],["kind",188.19,188.49],["we",188.49,188.73],["use",188.73,189.01],["for",189.01,189.25],["drinking",189.25,189.63],["nowadays.",189.63,190.15],["They'd",191.11,191.37]]},{"start":191.37,"end":198.41,"text":"have sucked the paint up into it, then blown it out. Researchers have recently recreated","words":[["have",191.37,191.47],["sucked",191.47,191.87],["the",191.87,192.15],["paint",192.15,192.43],["up",192.43,192.75],["into",192.75,193.09],["it,",193.09,193.39],["then",193.45,193.73],["blown",193.73,194.09],["it",194.09,194.35],["out.",194.35,194.63],["Researchers",195.95,196.39],["have",196.39,197.05],["recently",197.05,197.63],["recreated",197.63,198.41]]},{"start":198.41,"end":204.79,"text":"both the paint and the processes used to make the hand symbols. The artist would have first","words":[["both",198.41,198.83],["the",198.83,199.05],["paint",199.05,199.43],["and",199.43,199.81],["the",199.81,199.97],["processes",199.97,200.33],["used",200.33,200.91],["to",200.91,201.43],["make",201.43,201.69],["the",201.69,201.91],["hand",201.91,202.15],["symbols.",202.15,202.53],["The",203.57,203.83],["artist",203.83,204.23],["would",204.23,204.45],["have",204.45,204.55],["first",204.55,204.79]]},{"start":204.79,"end":210.83,"text":"put his hand flat against the wall, then blown the paint onto the wall, creating an outline","words":[["put",204.79,205.07],["his",205.07,205.27],["hand",205.27,205.53],["flat",205.53,205.95],["against",205.95,206.35],["the",206.35,206.63],["wall,",206.63,206.95],["then",207.33,207.63],["blown",207.63,207.97],["the",207.97,208.25],["paint",208.25,208.59],["onto",208.59,208.95],["the",208.95,209.17],["wall,",209.17,209.53],["creating",209.81,210.19],["an",210.19,210.49],["outline",210.49,210.83]]},{"start":210.83,"end":216.15,"text":"line of the hand. The researchers who've tried to recreate the process have said that","words":[["line",210.83,211.03],["of",211.03,211.29],["the",211.29,211.47],["hand.",211.47,211.87],["The",212.61,212.89],["researchers",212.89,213.35],["who've",213.35,213.77],["tried",213.77,214.03],["to",214.03,214.25],["recreate",214.25,214.47],["the",214.47,214.85],["process",214.85,215.25],["have",215.25,215.61],["said",215.61,215.89],["that",215.89,216.15]]},{"start":216.15,"end":221.81,"text":"not only is it a difficult technique to master, but also that a strange noise is produced.","words":[["not",216.15,216.37],["only",216.37,216.81],["is",216.81,217.13],["it",217.13,217.23],["a",217.23,217.35],["difficult",217.35,217.77],["technique",217.77,218.27],["to",218.27,218.49],["master,",218.49,218.77],["but",219.39,219.53],["also",219.53,219.95],["that",219.95,220.19],["a",220.19,220.27],["strange",220.27,220.67],["noise",220.67,221.19],["is",221.19,221.43],["produced.",221.43,221.81]]},{"start":222.77,"end":228.25,"text":"It also led them to feel light-headed, so we can only imagine that these cave artists","words":[["It",222.77,222.99],["also",222.99,223.33],["led",223.33,223.55],["them",223.55,223.73],["to",223.73,223.83],["feel",223.83,224.11],["light",224.11,224.51],["-headed,",224.51,224.89],["so",225.31,225.69],["we",225.69,225.99],["can",225.99,226.15],["only",226.15,226.53],["imagine",226.53,227.03],["that",227.03,227.29],["these",227.29,227.51],["cave",227.51,227.83],["artists",227.83,228.25]]},{"start":228.25,"end":238.17,"text":"felt the same. I'm sure you'll agree that these symbols are really interesting but","words":[["felt",228.25,228.59],["the",228.59,228.77],["same.",228.77,229.13],["I'm",234.15,234.55],["sure",234.55,234.87],["you'll",234.87,235.13],["agree",235.13,235.37],["that",235.37,235.57],["these",235.57,235.75],["symbols",235.75,236.11],["are",236.11,236.49],["really",236.49,236.87],["interesting",236.87,237.43],["but",237.43,238.17]]},{"start":238.17,"end":244.83,"text":"they're also of vital importance. Researchers have now identified a total of 26 symbols","words":[["they're",238.17,238.39],["also",238.39,238.79],["of",238.79,239.09],["vital",239.09,239.39],["importance.",239.39,240.13],["Researchers",240.93,241.31],["have",241.31,241.81],["now",241.81,242.13],["identified",242.13,242.83],["a",242.83,243.15],["total",243.15,243.39],["of",243.39,243.59],["26",243.59,244.23],["symbols",244.23,244.83]]},{"start":244.83,"end":250.51,"text":"commonly used in France and Spain. We only have this knowledge thanks to a database","words":[["commonly",244.83,245.27],["used",245.27,245.75],["in",245.75,245.99],["France",245.99,246.39],["and",246.39,246.81],["Spain.",246.81,247.27],["We",248.23,248.47],["only",248.47,248.71],["have",248.71,248.99],["this",248.99,249.21],["knowledge",249.21,249.55],["thanks",249.55,249.79],["to",249.79,250.01],["a",250.01,250.15],["database",250.15,250.51]]},{"start":250.51,"end":256.75,"text":"that's been created and which is being added to all the time. It clearly demonstrates that","words":[["that's",250.51,250.89],["been",250.89,251.07],["created",251.07,251.53],["and",251.53,252.29],["which",252.29,252.55],["is",252.55,252.75],["being",252.75,252.93],["added",252.93,253.23],["to",253.23,253.55],["all",253.55,253.93],["the",253.93,254.09],["time.",254.09,254.51],["It",255.07,255.27],["clearly",255.27,255.73],["demonstrates",255.73,256.31],["that",256.31,256.75]]},{"start":256.75,"end":261.89,"text":"many symbols are often used in particular combinations, even if they're in different","words":[["many",256.75,257.13],["symbols",257.13,257.55],["are",257.55,257.95],["often",257.95,258.29],["used",258.29,258.59],["in",258.59,258.85],["particular",258.85,259.37],["combinations,",259.37,260.19],["even",260.57,261.05],["if",261.05,261.31],["they're",261.31,261.53],["in",261.53,261.63],["different",261.63,261.89]]},{"start":261.89,"end":268.65,"text":"places. This is significant as it looks like different tribes of cave people who lived","words":[["places.",261.89,262.37],["This",263.47,263.89],["is",263.89,264.15],["significant",264.15,264.81],["as",264.81,265.63],["it",265.63,265.77],["looks",265.77,266.05],["like",266.05,266.39],["different",266.39,266.79],["tribes",266.79,267.13],["of",267.13,267.39],["cave",267.39,267.63],["people",267.63,268.03],["who",268.03,268.35],["lived",268.35,268.65]]},{"start":268.65,"end":273.71,"text":"and travelled through the area at that time would have seen these markings as well as","words":[["and",268.65,269.05],["travelled",269.05,269.47],["through",269.47,269.83],["the",269.83,269.99],["area",269.99,270.37],["at",270.37,270.61],["that",270.61,270.79],["time",270.79,271.23],["would",271.23,271.73],["have",271.73,271.87],["seen",271.87,272.19],["these",272.19,272.43],["markings",272.43,272.85],["as",272.85,273.33],["well",273.33,273.57],["as",273.57,273.71]]},{"start":273.71,"end":279.73,"text":"adding to them. Although researchers don't believe that these symbols are a language as such,","words":[["adding",273.71,274.01],["to",274.01,274.29],["them.",274.29,274.55],["Although",275.31,275.89],["researchers",275.89,276.59],["don't",276.59,276.97],["believe",276.97,277.21],["that",277.21,277.39],["these",277.39,277.61],["symbols",277.61,277.95],["are",277.95,278.35],["a",278.35,278.59],["language",278.59,279.03],["as",279.03,279.37],["such,",279.37,279.73]]},{"start":280.07,"end":286.91,"text":"they are happy to call them a type of code. There is evidence to support this idea. One","words":[["they",280.07,280.29],["are",280.29,280.41],["happy",280.41,280.69],["to",280.69,280.87],["call",280.87,281.09],["them",281.09,281.27],["a",281.27,281.45],["type",281.45,281.65],["of",281.65,281.79],["code.",281.79,282.17],["There",283.13,283.49],["is",283.49,283.81],["evidence",283.81,284.25],["to",284.25,284.57],["support",284.57,284.99],["this",284.99,285.19],["idea.",285.19,285.59],["One",286.47,286.91]]},{"start":286.91,"end":294.29,"text":"sequence of five symbols is particularly common in caves in Spain. Exactly the same sequence","words":[["sequence",286.91,287.33],["of",287.33,287.85],["five",287.85,288.27],["symbols",288.27,288.77],["is",288.77,289.23],["particularly",289.23,289.73],["common",289.73,290.17],["in",290.17,290.49],["caves",290.49,290.87],["in",290.87,291.19],["Spain.",291.19,291.63],["Exactly",292.65,293.23],["the",293.23,293.53],["same",293.53,293.85],["sequence",293.85,294.29]]},{"start":294.29,"end":300.17,"text":"of five symbols has been found carved into a necklace made from the teeth of a red deer.","words":[["of",294.29,294.53],["five",294.53,294.87],["symbols",294.87,295.39],["has",295.39,295.63],["been",295.63,295.81],["found",295.81,296.13],["carved",296.13,296.59],["into",296.59,296.99],["a",296.99,297.21],["necklace",297.21,297.57],["made",297.57,298.43],["from",298.43,298.65],["the",298.65,298.79],["teeth",298.79,299.05],["of",299.05,299.33],["a",299.33,299.45],["red",299.45,299.75],["deer.",299.75,300.17]]},{"start":300.17,"end":305.85,"text":"So, it appears that this combination of symbols may have had a special meaning.","words":[["So,",300.17,301.31],["it",301.59,301.71],["appears",301.71,302.15],["that",302.15,302.45],["this",302.45,302.65],["combination",302.65,303.11],["of",303.11,303.45],["symbols",303.45,303.87],["may",303.87,304.49],["have",304.49,304.73],["had",304.73,304.95],["a",304.95,305.09],["special",305.09,305.41],["meaning.",305.41,305.85]]},{"start":306.87,"end":313.83,"text":"Of course, many of these explanations are theory as opposed to hard facts, which is why there","words":[["Of",306.87,307.13],["course,",307.13,307.51],["many",307.99,308.45],["of",308.45,308.75],["these",308.75,308.93],["explanations",308.93,309.51],["are",309.51,310.11],["theory",310.11,310.61],["as",310.61,311.11],["opposed",311.11,311.47],["to",311.47,311.79],["hard",311.79,311.99],["facts,",311.99,312.45],["which",312.93,313.19],["is",313.19,313.35],["why",313.35,313.59],["there",313.59,313.83]]},{"start":313.83,"end":317.87,"text":"is disagreement among researchers about the significance of what we are seeing.","words":[["is",313.83,314.01],["disagreement",314.01,314.43],["among",314.43,314.89],["researchers",314.89,315.55],["about",315.55,315.97],["the",315.97,316.15],["significance",316.15,316.63],["of",316.63,317.07],["what",317.07,317.29],["we",317.29,317.49],["are",317.49,317.59],["seeing.",317.59,317.87]]},{"start":318.73,"end":321.89,"text":"One theory is called the Great Leap Forward.","words":[["One",318.73,319.17],["theory",319.17,319.51],["is",319.51,319.95],["called",319.95,320.29],["the",320.29,320.67],["Great",320.67,320.99],["Leap",320.99,321.49],["Forward.",321.49,321.89]]},{"start":322.71,"end":328.87,"text":"The idea is that around 35,000 years ago there was a sudden increase in creativity","words":[["The",322.71,323.21],["idea",323.21,323.67],["is",323.67,324.05],["that",324.05,324.25],["around",324.25,324.49],["35",324.49,325.09],[",000",325.09,325.67],["years",325.67,325.95],["ago",325.95,326.37],["there",326.37,326.95],["was",326.95,327.09],["a",327.09,327.25],["sudden",327.25,327.49],["increase",327.49,328.03],["in",328.03,328.25],["creativity",328.25,328.87]]},{"start":328.87,"end":336.01,"text":"which led to the invention of the boat among other things. However, not everyone agrees.","words":[["which",328.87,329.57],["led",329.57,329.99],["to",329.99,330.21],["the",330.21,330.31],["invention",330.31,330.71],["of",330.71,330.95],["the",330.95,331.05],["boat",331.05,331.49],["among",331.49,332.11],["other",332.11,332.55],["things.",332.55,332.95],["However,",333.69,334.17],["not",334.67,335.03],["everyone",335.03,335.55],["agrees.",335.55,336.01]]},{"start":336.67,"end":342.41,"text":"In fact, many scientists believe that what has been found in Africa seems to indicate","words":[["In",336.67,336.87],["fact,",336.87,337.35],["many",337.71,337.87],["scientists",337.87,338.41],["believe",338.41,338.93],["that",338.93,339.27],["what",339.27,339.47],["has",339.47,339.65],["been",339.65,339.81],["found",339.81,340.09],["in",340.09,340.35],["Africa",340.35,340.87],["seems",340.87,341.77],["to",341.77,342.01],["indicate",342.01,342.41]]},{"start":342.41,"end":348.89,"text":"that this increase in creativity happened much earlier, around seventy to ninety thousand","words":[["that",342.41,342.67],["this",342.67,342.89],["increase",342.89,343.31],["in",343.31,343.57],["creativity",343.57,344.19],["happened",344.19,344.95],["much",344.95,345.39],["earlier,",345.39,346.03],["around",346.57,347.03],["seventy",347.03,347.77],["to",347.77,348.13],["ninety",348.13,348.53],["thousand",348.53,348.89]]},{"start":348.89,"end":354.79,"text":"years ago and more gradually. One example of an artefact that is offered to support","words":[["years",348.89,349.15],["ago",349.15,349.49],["and",349.49,350.19],["more",350.19,350.47],["gradually.",350.47,350.95],["One",351.85,352.19],["example",352.19,352.63],["of",352.63,353.07],["an",353.07,353.17],["artefact",353.17,353.73],["that",353.73,353.91],["is",353.91,354.03],["offered",354.03,354.27],["to",354.27,354.45],["support",354.45,354.79]]},{"start":354.79,"end":360.71,"text":"the idea is the discovery of different sorts of arrows, which would have been used for hunting.","words":[["the",354.79,355.03],["idea",355.03,355.37],["is",355.37,355.99],["the",355.99,356.11],["discovery",356.11,356.49],["of",356.49,356.77],["different",356.77,357.05],["sorts",357.05,357.35],["of",357.35,357.59],["arrows,",357.59,357.97],["which",358.59,359.27],["would",359.27,359.49],["have",359.49,359.67],["been",359.67,359.83],["used",359.83,360.15],["for",360.15,360.37],["hunting.",360.37,360.71]]},{"start":361.83,"end":366.79,"text":"These scientists suggest that the reason more symbols haven't been found from this earlier time","words":[["These",361.83,362.19],["scientists",362.19,362.75],["suggest",362.75,363.29],["that",363.29,363.57],["the",363.57,363.69],["reason",363.69,363.99],["more",363.99,364.25],["symbols",364.25,364.63],["haven't",364.63,365.05],["been",365.05,365.25],["found",365.25,365.61],["from",365.61,365.77],["this",365.77,365.97],["earlier",365.97,366.35],["time",366.35,366.79]]},{"start":366.79,"end":371.51,"text":"is because they would have been painted on things that did not survive, such as wood.","words":[["is",366.79,367.35],["because",367.35,367.59],["they",367.59,367.77],["would",367.77,367.89],["have",367.89,368.01],["been",368.01,368.15],["painted",368.15,368.63],["on",368.63,368.85],["things",368.85,369.11],["that",369.11,369.33],["did",369.33,369.55],["not",369.55,369.73],["survive,",369.73,370.29],["such",370.65,370.97],["as",370.97,371.21],["wood.",371.21,371.51]]},{"start":372.35,"end":377.81,"text":"In fact, we are very lucky that caves have protected these specimens as well as they have,","words":[["In",372.35,372.57],["fact,",372.57,373.03],["we",373.33,373.63],["are",373.63,373.75],["very",373.75,374.05],["lucky",374.05,374.39],["that",374.39,374.59],["caves",374.59,374.99],["have",374.99,375.23],["protected",375.23,375.73],["these",375.73,375.99],["specimens",375.99,376.43],["as",376.43,376.87],["well",376.87,377.15],["as",377.15,377.31],["they",377.31,377.43],["have,",377.43,377.81]]},{"start":378.13,"end":381.61,"text":"or we might never have known what these artists were capable of.","words":[["or",378.13,378.39],["we",378.39,378.55],["might",378.55,378.71],["never",378.71,379.15],["have",379.15,379.37],["known",379.37,379.67],["what",379.67,379.99],["these",379.99,380.23],["artists",380.23,380.63],["were",380.63,380.93],["capable",380.93,381.19],["of.",381.19,381.61]]},{"start":384.4,"end":386.78,"text":"That is the end of Part 4.","words":[["That",384.4,385.34],["is",385.34,385.46],["the",385.46,385.6],["end",385.6,385.94],["of",385.94,386.12],["Part",386.12,386.32],["4.",386.32,386.78]]},{"start":387.46,"end":391.1,"text":"You now have one minute to check your answers to Part 4.","words":[["You",387.46,387.72],["now",387.72,387.98],["have",387.98,388.32],["one",388.32,388.64],["minute",388.64,389.06],["to",389.06,389.36],["check",389.36,389.68],["your",389.68,389.88],["answers",389.88,390.24],["to",390.24,390.52],["Part",39